<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - GST Telecom raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - GST Telecom raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it upgraded GST Telecommunications Inc to strong buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 5/8 to 11-1/4.</p>
</text>
